Exactly. The missing piece is the return path from symbols to reality.

Humans can become trapped in increasingly self-referential worlds: memes referencing memes, opinions responding to opinions, narratives reinforcing narratives.

Eventually, people can become fluent in the representation of an experience without having much experience of the thing itself.

That’s where grounding matters.

